3. Question One – Role of the Operating Systems

An OS manages the resources of the computer and provides an interface for the user. Windows 11 has a number of tools to Manage User Accounts, processes, memory, files, and devices [1], [2].

3.1 User Accounts

Windows can provide different users with their own account. ApliSoft can set up an administrator account for their IT employee and set up standard user accounts for other employees.

As an administrator account can make important changes to the system, whilst standard users give less privilege. This prevents any unwanted changes to the computer [1], [3].

